 -weekday proxies from SaTML 2027\; past meetings have ranged from Februar
 y to May.\nScope: Security\, safety\, and trustworthiness of machine lear
 ning. Characteristic work studies attacks and defenses\, privacy\, verifi
 cation\, ML-system security\, fairness\, interpretability\, and trustwort
 hy data curation. Theoretical\, empirical\, and applied papers must engag
 e substantively with a safety or trustworthiness question\; merely using 
 an ML model is insufficient.\nAdditional topics: Machine Learning\, ML Sy
 stems & Infrastructure\nScope sources (2027): https://satml.org/call-for-
 papers/\nScope last checked: 2026-10-07
